<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon La</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon La</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon ni a thut e lanaw thung dawk e la lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pahni hoi paconae hoi kai hah na paco haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nange lungpatawnae teh misurtui hlak ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kâhluk e hmuitui ni na kaying toe. Nange na min teh awi e hmuitui lah ao. Hatdawkvah tanglakacuemnaw ni nang teh na lungpataw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai hah na hrawi nateh, karanglah yawng lei sei. Nang siangpahrang ni kai teh amae inae khan thung na kaw toe. Nang dawk ka lunghawi vaiteh ka konawm han. Na lungpatawnae hah misurtui hlak ka pouk han. Nang teh na lungpataw katang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oe Jerusalem canu, kai teh Kedar rim patetlah ka tamang eiteh, Solomon siangpahrang e im dawk yap e hni patetlah a mei kahawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tamang poung e kaie ka takthai kecu dawk, kahawi hoeh lah na hmawt awh han. Ka manu e capanaw ni kai koe a lungkhuek awh teh, misur takhanaw hah, ka ring hanelah ka rakueng awh toe. Kaie misur takha teh ka ring hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kaie ka lungthin thung dawk Ka pahren e tami, na tuhu hah nâ e hmuen koe vaimoe, a khoum awh vaiyoe, kanîthun vah na e hmuen koe vaimoe a kâhat sak vaiyoe. Kai hah na dei pouh haw. Kai teh bangkongmaw na hui tuhu naw rahak vah hro e patetlah khuet ka o han va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Napuinaw thung dawk a mei kahawipoung e lah na Oe na ka panuek hoehpawiteh, tunaw e hnukkâbang haw. Tukhoumnaw e rim teng vah, nange hmaeca hah rawca poe haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka pahren e tawncanu, nang teh Faro siangpahrang e ranglengnaw thung dawk e marang hoi na bangnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nange na tamboungnaw teh talung phu kaawm poung e lah ao teh, na lahuen teh suidingyin hoi na meihawi poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang hanelah ngun hoi sak e suihnapacap hai kaimouh ni na sak pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang siangpahrang teh ahnie caboi dawk na tahung nah kai koehoi, ka tho e hmuitui hmui ni kaying e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai ni ka pahren e nang e, murah hmuitui tabu ca teh, kaie lungtabue dawkvah rum touh thung ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai ni ka pahren e nang teh, kai hanelah Engedi misur takha dawk e Henna pei patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pahren e ka tawncanu, nang teh na mei ahawipoung. Na hawi poung. Nange na mit teh bakhu mit na tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kai ni ka pahren e nang teh na mei ahawipoung. Ngai a tho poung. Ka lung a nawm sak. Maimae ikhun teh hringsuepcalah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maimae im khomnaw teh, Sidar thing, a lemphu teh hmaicathing e doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai teh Sharon e rosi pei hoi kâvan teh ayawn dawk e lili pei lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka pahren e nang teh, ka lungpataw e tangla, pâkhingum e, lili pei patetlah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kahrawngum ka paw e Epal thingkung patetlah ka pahren nang teh, thoundounnaw e rahak na o. Kai teh ahnie tâhlip dawk kanawmca lah ka o teh, a paw teh kai hanelah a radip poung oe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahni ni kai teh buvennae im koe na hrawi teh, kaie lathueng a yap e hni teh a lungpatawnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai teh ngaipatawnae hoi ka o dawkvah misur hoi Epal paw hoi lung bout na pahawi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahnie avoilae a kut ka lû rahim a ta teh, aranglae kut hoi na takawi na seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oe Jerusalem canu ka pahren e teh, a mahmawk a kâhlaw hoeh roukrak na pâhlaw awh hoeh nahanelah, kahrawng e sayuk sakhinaw thoebo laihoi nangmouh teh lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khenhaw! ka pahren e lawk doeh. Montang monruinaw yawngtapue laihoi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka pahren e teh, sayuk sakhi ca patetlah ao. Rapan lawilah a kangdue. Hlalangaw koe a khet teh, hlalangaw koe a kâpâtue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pahren ni na kaw teh, a dei e lawk teh, ka pahren poung e tangla, a meikahawi e, thaw nateh tho haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenhaw! kasik hai aloum teh cotui hai abaw toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Talai van vah, a peinaw a kamhlawng toe. Tavanaw hai a cainae tue a pha toe. Maimae ram vah, bakhu lawk hai thai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thaibunglung kung a pawnaw hai a hmin toe. Misurkung hai a pei teh, a hmuitui toe. Ka pahren e ka imlawinu, a meikahawi poung e, thaw nateh tho leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungsong rahak e bakhu, na mei heh na hmawt sak haw. Na lawk hai na thaisak haw. Na lawk a rading teh na mei teh ngai ao poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maimae misurnaw teh a pei lahun toung dawkvah, misurkungnaw ka raphoe hane Asuinaw hoi Asuicanaw hah man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaie ka pahren e teh kai hanelah ao e patetlah kai hai ahni hanelah ka o. Ahni teh tucahunaw hah kahrawngum a khoum teh a kawkhik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khohmo a kahma teh, khodai totouh ka pahren teh Bether mon dawk e sayuk sakhi patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungthung hoi ka pahren e hateh, karum vah ka inae koehoi ka tawng. Hateiteh ka hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atu ka thaw teh khothung ka lawngven teh lam tangkuem hoi tami a kamkhuengnae hmuennaw koe ka lungthinthung hoi ka pahren nang teh na tawng. Hateiteh na hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khoipui ka ring e ramvengnaw ni hai na hmu awh. Ahnimouh koe ka pahren hah na hmu awh maw telah ka pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh koung tapoung hoi a ro hoehnahlan, ka pahren e teh ka hmu. Ahni hah ka kuet teh, ka khenae, anu imthungkhu totouh ka hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oe Jerusalem canunaw ka pahren teh amahmawk a kâhlaw hoeh roukrak na pâhlaw awh hoeh nahanelah, kahrawng e sayuk sakhinaw thoebo laihoi, nangmouh teh lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Murah hoi frankinsen koehoi hno kayawtnaw ni a yo e hmuituinaw pueng hah, hmaisawi toteh ka khu e hmaikhukhom patetlah kahrawngum hoi ka tâcawt e teh api nama.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenhaw! Solomon kâkayawtnae doeh. Isarel athakaawme taminaw, athakaawme 60 touh hoi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hotnaw abuemlah teh tarantuk hanelah tahloi ka patuem e tarankahawinaw doeh. Karum lae atueng nah puen hanelah ao dawkvah, tami pueng ni tahloi coungkacoelah a neng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Solomon siangpahrang ni Lebanon thing hoi ama hanelah, kâkayawtnae hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Alungui e khomnaw hah, ngun hoi, a rahim e naw hah sui hoi, tahung nahane carawng hah Opaou e hni hoi a sak. Athung lae naw teh, Jerusalem canunaw ni lungpatawnae hoi a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion canunaw kâpaluen e hnin hoi, lungthin a nawmnae hnin nah, a manu ni oupnae bawilakhung hah kâmuk sak e Solomon siangpahrang hah cet nateh khen awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka pahren e, nang teh na meihawipoung. Na meihawi tangngak na mit teh minhmai ramuk thung kaawm e Bakhu e mit hoi a kâvan. Nange na sam teh, Gilead mon hoi ka kum e hmaehu patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nange na hânaw teh a muen ngaw teh thoung sak hnukkhu, ka takhang e tuhu patetlah ao. Buet touh hai kahmat hoeh. Suetalah a kamphek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nange na pahni teh langsanrui hoi a kâvan. Nange na lawk teh a pâdingsue. Nange na minhmai ramuk thung kaawm e, nange na hnâlakheng teh tale paw tangawntangai hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lahuen hai Devit ni a sak e imrasang hoi a kâvan. Athakaawme taminaw e bahlingnaw pueng, hawvah bahling 1,000 touh a bang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na sanu roi teh ayawn dawk ka pouh e sayuk sakhi samphei hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kanî a khup hoi kanîka suirasai totouh, Murah mon hoi frankinsen mon totouh ka cei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pahren e nang dawk toun hane banghai awmhoeh. Na meihawi toungloung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka imlawinu, kai hoi lebanon mon hoi tho haw. Kai hoi Lebanon mon hoi kum haw. Amana monsom, Senir mon hoi, Hermon monsom, sendek e kâkhu, takainaw a onae mon dawkvah khenhaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaie ka tangla, ka tawncanu, nang ni ka lungmuenti sak toe. Na mit hoi vai touh na khet e hoi lahuen vai touh na pahei e ni, kaie ka lungthin teh muen na ti sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaie ka tangla, ka tawncanu, nange lungpatawnae teh a radip poung. Nange lung na patawnae teh misurtui hlak hoe ahawi. Hmuituinaw hlak hai na tui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kaie tangla, nange na pahni teh khoipha patetlah a lawi. Na lai rahim sanutui hoi khoitui ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaie tangla, ka tawncanu, ka khan e takha ka tungdum e tuiim, tacikkin e tuiphuek lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nange thingthainaw teh, ka radip e a paw hoi talepawnaw onae takha, hennakung hoi a hmuituinaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmuitui, spiknard hoi saffron, kalamus, nakzik thing hoi, frankinsen, murah, aloe hmuitui, phunkuep ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Takha thung e naw, tui bu nahanelah tuiim, tuiphueknaw, lebanon mon hoi ka lawng e tuinaw hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tung lae kahlî thaw haw, akalae kahlî tho haw. Kaie takha dawkvah tho awh haw. A hmuituinae naw teh kâkahei naseh. Ka pahren e ni takha thung kâen vaiteh ka radip e paw hah cat naseh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaie ka tangla ka tawncanu, ka takha thung kai ka tho toe. Kai ni Murah hoi a hmuitui e phun hah ka pâkhueng toe. Khoitui hoi khoiphanaw hah ka ca toe. Ka huinaw cat awh, net awh, Oe ka pahren, ka boum lah cat net.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kai teh ka i lahun nahai ka lungthin teh a kâhlaw doeh. Ka pahren e lawk teh ka thai doeh. Kaie bakhu, ka pahren e, ka tawncanu, tamikalan, kai hane na paawng pouh haw. Ka lû teh tadamtui hoi, ka samnaw hai karum kabawt e tadamtui hoi a duk toe telah ati teh tho a takhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaie ka khohna e teh ka rading toe. Bangtelamaw bout ka kho han. Ka khoknaw hai ka pâsu toe. Bangkong bout kakhin sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pahren ni kut hoi takhang hah ka tanawt teh a paawng torei teh, kaie ka lungthin teh ahni dawk noenae ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pahren hanelah takhang paawng pouh hane ka thaw navah, kaie ka kut dawk hoi Murah satui dek a ca. Murah satui teh kaie kutcarei rahak hoi tho khannae dawk hoi a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pahren hanelah tho ka paawng pouh navah, Hatei ka pahren teh yo la a tâco toe. Ahnie lawk thai han ka ngai dawk ahni teh ka tawng ei, ka hmawt hoeh, ka kaw ei voi hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khopui ka ring e ramvengnaw ni na hmu navah puenghoi na hem awh. Khorapan karingkungnaw ni ka minhmai ramuk na lawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oe Jerusalem canunaw ka pahren hah, na kâhmo pawiteh, kai ni ka pahren lawi, ngaipataw e lah ka o e hah, ahni koe dei pouh loe telah nangmanaw lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Napuinaw thung dawk a meikahawi poung e, nang ni na pahren e teh, alouknaw e phrennae hoi bangtelamaw kâvanhoehnae . Kaimanaw hah hottelah lawk na thui nahanelah, na pahren e teh alouknaw e pahrennae hoi bangtelamaw a kâvanhoehnae,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pahren teh, a pangaw palingnae hoi a kawi e teh tami thong hra touh thung dawk ka talue poung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnie a lû dawkvah, sui patetlah suituici patetlah ao. Ahnie sam teh atha teh, vonga patetlah a tamang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnie mit teh palang teng vah sanutui hoi pâsu e bakhunaw hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnie tamboung teh hmuitui e a pei hmui, hmuitui ungnae kahrawngum patetlah ao. Ahnie pahni teh, murah tui kalawng e lili pei patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnie kutnaw teh talung hoi pathoup e suikuthrawt patetlah ahnie tak teh Sapphire lung hoi pathoup e loukloukkaang e kasaino patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahnie khok teh, suikhom dawk sak e talung phukaawm e khom hoi a kâvan. Ahnie a meilam teh, Lebanon mon patetlah ao teh, Sidar thing patetlah a talue poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hni e pahni teh a radip poung teh, a takthai abuemlah ngai a tho poung Jerusalem canu ahni teh ka pahren e ka hui lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Napuinaw thung dawk a mei kahawipoung e ka tawncanu, nange na pahren e teh nâ e hmuen koe maw a cei vai. Kaimouh ni nang hoi reirei tawng hanelah, nange pahren e teh, namaw na kâceihlinghlang roi tie hah dei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka pahren teh, a pawnaw cat vaiteh, lili peinaw ka la han a titeh, takha thung hmuitui onae koe lah a cei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pahren hanelah kai teh ka o. Ka pahren hai kai hanelah ao. Ayawn dawk ka pouh e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pahren e ka tawncanu, nang teh Tirzah kho patetlah na mei ahawi. Jerusalem kho patetlah ngai ao. Taran kâtuknae koe e patetlah taki kawi lah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nange na mit teh, kai koehoi alouklah kangvawi leih. Ahnimouh ni kai teh na tâ toe. Nange na san teh, Gilead mon hoi ka kum e hmaehu patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nange na hânaw teh tui pâhluknae koehoi ka luen e tuhu patetlah ao. Buet touh hai kahmat hoeh. Kamphei e dueng doeh a khe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na minhmai ramuknae thung kaawm e na tangboungnaw teh talepaw tangawntangai hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang napui 60, a yu ado lah 80, touklek thai hoeh e tanglakacuemnaw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaie bakhu, kaie ka kuep e, buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Ahni ka khe e manu ni a pahren poung e lah ao. Tanglanaw ni ahni hah a hmu teh, yawhawi a poe awh. Siangpahrangnu hoi a yudonaw ni hai ahni teh a pholen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thapa patetlah ahawi teh, kanî patetlah a sei teh, tarankâtuknae koe e patetlah taki hanlah na o. Amom patetlah ngaihawi laihoi ka khen e teh apimaw .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai teh misurkung roung hai a roung hoeh hai, Tale a pei hoi a pei hoeh e hai panue hanelah, ka khetyawt hanelah takha koe ka cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai ka panue hoehnahlan vah, ka muitha teh, Aminadab leng dawk kâcuie patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oe bawi canu, khokkhawm na khawm laihoi na khoknaw teh a kamcu poung. Na phainaw teh kathoumnaw ni a sak e aphu kaawm e talung patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nange na keng teh tui hoi ka kawi e manang lah ao. Na vonpui hai, lili pei hoi ka kawi e cakang pung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sanu roi teh sayukca kamphei e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nange na lahuen teh, kasaino imrasang patetlah na mit teh, Heshbon kho, Bethrabbim longkha teng kaawm e, tuiim patetlah na hnawng teh Damaskas kho koe ka kangvawi e, lebanon im hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nange na lû dawk kaawm e bawilakhung teh, Karmel mon hoi a kâvan. Nange na lû dawk kaawm e na sam hai, opaou e hni hoi a kâvan. Siangpahrang ni sam a vei e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pahren e ka tawncanu, nang teh, kai ka nawm nahanelah ahawi poung. Ngai kaawm poung e nuen hoi na kawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nange na rasangravuinae teh, samtuekung patetlah na o teh nange sanunaw hai samtuepaw hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samtuekung dawk ka luen vaiteh, a kangnaw hah ka tek han ka ti navah nange sanunaw teh misurbom patetlah thoseh, na kâha hmui teh, Epal hmui patetlah thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nange na pahni hai katuipounge misurtui patetlah thoseh ao. Hote misurtui teh ka pahren hanelah kalancalah a lawng. Kaipnaw e pahni dawk pouk laipalah a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaie ka pahren e tami teh, kaie lah ao patetlah ahnie a ngainae teh kaie lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tho leih, ka pahren e, kahrawng e hmuen koe cei vaiteh, khonaw dawk tangmin lae atueng loum sak awh sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amom lah misur takha koe cet awh sei. Misurkung a hring, hring hoeh maw, a paw rano moi rano hoeh maw, khenhaw! sei. Hote hmuen dawk ka lungpataw e nang hah na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hloisikungnaw ni hmuitui e kaimae longkha teng radip e a paw katha hoi, karuem e abuemlah ka pahren nang hanelah ka pâtung toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang koe kaie manu e sanutui karadip e, ka net e, ka thangroi patetlah o sak han ka ngai. Kai ni nang teh, alawilah kâhmo vaiteh, na paco nakunghai ayânaw ni kai teh na pathoe mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anu e irakhan na kut dawk hoi na hrawi vaiteh na ceikhai han. Ahni ni hai kai hai na cangkhai han. Kai ni tâsi hoi kalawt e misurtui hoi taletui hah na nei sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnie avoilah, e kut kaie ka lû rahim a hruek vaiteh, aranglae kut hoi na takawi seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Oe Jerusalem canunaw, ka pahren e teh amahmawk a kâhlaw hoehroukrak na pâhlaw awh hoeh nahanelah, kahrawng e sayuk sakhinaw noe lahoi lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pahren dawk kamngawi laihoi kahrawngum hoi ka tho e hateh api han namaw. Epal thingkung rahim nang teh na pâhlaw toe. Hote hmuen koe nange na manu ni nang teh na hâ toe. Hote hmuen koe nang na khe teh, hâ e lah na hruek toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai teh nange na lung dawkvah tacik na kin leih lah. Na kut dawk hai tacik na kin leih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungpatawnae teh, due e patetlah a thao. Dipmanae lungthin teh phuen kho patetlah a ru. Ahnie a hue teh, hmaisaan hoi hmaito patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatnavah, tuinaw ni lungpatawnae roum sak thai hoeh. Tuikalen ni hai pâyawt thai hoeh. Tami ni ama im kaawm hnopai pueng lungpatawnae lahoi poe han a ngai nakunghai puenghoi dudamnae doeh kâhmo ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaimouh koevah kanaw rae ka tawncanu buet touh ao rah. Ahni teh sanu co hoeh rah. Hote ka tawncanu a pacei awh navah, ahni hanelah bangtelamaw ka ti awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni teh rapan lah awm pawiteh, ahni van ngunrapan ka sak han. Takhang lah awm pawiteh Sidar thing hoi ka kalup han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai teh kho rapan lah ka o. Kaie sanu hai imrasang patetlah o. Hatdawkvah, kai teh nang na hmalah hawinae ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baalhamon ram dawk takha buet touh ao. Hote misur takha teh, karingkungnaw koe ka hlai sak teh a paw a ca phu lah shekel thawng touh rip a sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tawn e misur takha teh kahma lah ao. Oe Solomon, ngun shekel thong touh nama hanelah ao teh, karingkungnaw ni cumhni touh rip a la awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Takha thung kaawm e, nange tami na huikonaw ni nange na lawk teh a ngai awh. Kai hai na thaisak van awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pahren nang kai koe karanglah tho leih. Hmuitui monnaw dawk kaawm e sayuk sakhicanaw patetlah na awm sak haw.
  </para>
</usx>
